{"name":"Picniccore","title":"Picniccore","revision":236012,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Picniccore","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Picniccore is an aesthetic based on picnics, gingham patterns, pastries, and jam. It centers around creating a relaxed atmosphere for outdoor gatherings and offers an opportunity to enjoy a delicious handmade lunch in the beauty of nature."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visuals"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"TBA"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Picniccore fashion is split into 2 categories: aesthetics and functionality. If aesthetics are valued over practicality, the fashion can consist of cute picnic dresses. But if you prefer practical clothes, you may choose to wear aprons."},{"kind":"list","text":"Shirts with puffy sleeves"},{"kind":"list","text":"Button blouses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lolita type dresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Dresses with big, puffy skirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Blouses with a bib neckline"},{"kind":"list","text":"Blouses with puritan necklines"},{"kind":"list","text":"Shirt dresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"House dresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sundresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cute aprons"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Bottoms"},{"kind":"list","text":"Shortalls or overalls"},{"kind":"list","text":"Flowy skirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Gathered skirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"A-line skirts"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Outerwear"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pinafore"},{"kind":"list","text":"Red shawls"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Footwear"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lacy leggings/tights"},{"kind":"list","text":"White socks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Mary Janes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sandals"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Accessories"},{"kind":"list","text":"Straw hats"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bandanas"},{"kind":"list","text":"Whimsical, dangly jewellery (e.g. butterfly earrings)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hair ties (e.g. scrunchies)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sunglasses"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Practical Clothing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Aprons"},{"kind":"list","text":"Oven mitts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hair scarves"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hair ties"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Other/Misc"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lace"},{"kind":"list","text":"Floral and gingham patterns"},{"kind":"list","text":"Soft blues, reds, pinks, greens, and yellows"},{"kind":"list","text":"Embroidered clothes with things like plants, fruits, and insects"},{"kind":"list","text":"Things with big pockets"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Television"},{"kind":"list","text":"Strawberry Shortcake"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Manga & Anime"},{"kind":"list","text":"Otherside Picnic"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Literature"},{"kind":"list","text":"Raggedy Ann book series"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Music"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Songs"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Activities"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"TBA"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/9/9b/Picnic_aesthetic.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240316062553","caption":"Picnic aesthetic","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Picnic_aesthetic.png","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0768-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/2/22/772D2C76-AFB0-4AC0-B348-3C6D36B02BFD.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20200918174439","caption":"Picniccore · Visual reference 02","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:772D2C76-AFB0-4AC0-B348-3C6D36B02BFD.jpeg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0768-2.webp","localAvailable":true}]}